          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
            <span style="font-size: 16px;">Pursuant to Section 23.2(A) of the General Terms and Conditions of Trunkline's FERC Gas Tariff, Fourth Revised Volume No. 1, Docket No. </span>
          </span>
          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
